# CITATION.cff

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, pipeline, or methodology in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Machine Learning-Based sEMG Prosthetic Gesture Classification Using the Ninapro DB5 Dataset"
abstract: "A reproducible, modular machine learning pipeline and framework for surface electromyography (sEMG) signal processing, feature engineering, Leave-One-Subject-Out (LOSO) cross-subject gesture classification, Explainable AI (SHAP) interpretation, and ONNX deployment using the Ninapro DB5 dataset."
authors:
